@startuml order-state-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title ORDER SERVICE - TRẠNG THÁI LIÊN QUAN ĐẾN THANH TOÁN VÀ DISPENSING

state "Order" as Order {
  [*] --> PENDING
  PENDING --> CONFIRMED : valid paid callback
  PENDING --> EXPIRED : order/payment expires
  PENDING --> CANCELLED : explicit status update
  CONFIRMED --> PROCESSING : dispensing processing
  CONFIRMED --> DISPENSED : terminal success
  CONFIRMED --> FAILED : terminal failure
  PROCESSING --> DISPENSED : terminal success
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : terminal failure
}

state "Payment" as Payment {
  [*] --> PAY_PENDING
  PAY_PENDING --> PAID : valid callback
  PAY_PENDING --> PAY_FAILED : failed callback
  PAY_PENDING --> PAY_EXPIRED : expires
}

state "DispensingCommand" as Dispensing {
  [*] --> NOT_REQUESTED
  NOT_REQUESTED --> REQUESTED : requestDispensing()
  REQUESTED --> ACCEPTED : Machine accepts
  ACCEPTED --> PROCESSING : polled result
  ACCEPTED --> DISPENSED : terminal result
  ACCEPTED --> DISP_FAILED : terminal failure
  REQUESTED --> UNKNOWN : uncertain HTTP outcome
  ACCEPTED --> UNKNOWN : invalid/mismatched response
  PROCESSING --> DISPENSED
  PROCESSING --> DISP_FAILED
}

note bottom
  SHIPPED/DELIVERED vẫn tồn tại trong OrderStatus nhưng không thuộc core kiosk dispensing flow.
  UNKNOWN yêu cầu manual review/reconciliation thay vì tự suy đoán kết quả.
end note

@enduml
